# Pins for the xbps container build (G-9). Sourced by sh and included by the Makefile,
# so keep it to plain KEY=value lines with no quotes.
#
# VOID_PACKAGES_REF: commit of github.com/void-linux/void-packages whose templates and
# xbps-src are used. Binary packages still come from the live Void repository, so this
# pins the build recipe, not every dependency.
# VOID_IMAGE_*: the Void base images, by digest, as pulled on 2026-10-16.
# VOID_IMAGE_SIGN: the image that signs the release repository (packaging/void/sign-repo.sh),
# as pulled on 2026-10-18.
#
# To bump: change the values, run `make xbps-container` for glibc and musl, and commit.
VOID_PACKAGES_REF=8b3fb194d3f05514643afd03a267bd6714385844
VOID_IMAGE_GLIBC=ghcr.io/void-linux/void-glibc-full@sha256:9533af64ff46c0173b671ebc3477857c622afdb36eaf11f51419adb0a32f9f90
VOID_IMAGE_MUSL=ghcr.io/void-linux/void-musl-full@sha256:095e0ec48ceca8ae18148ea81b473cd7a248bf02d5e2adb07a5e87fce3e317ed
VOID_IMAGE_SIGN=ghcr.io/void-linux/void-glibc@sha256:29eed7ad1b558f74d7383a87a9a32df67f3f20301a1b957ec26e3334cc207d21
